WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.055
You time a trolley rolling
down a ramp, five times.

2
00:00:03.105 --> 00:00:04.936
Two point one seconds.

3
00:00:04.986 --> 00:00:06.395
Two point nought.

4
00:00:06.445 --> 00:00:07.853
Two point two.

5
00:00:07.903 --> 00:00:09.312
Three point nine.

6
00:00:09.362 --> 00:00:10.770
Two point one.

7
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.390
Four of those results
sit close together.

8
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.050
One of them doesn't.

9
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.690
So what should you do with
the three point nine?

10
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.210
In this mission, you'll spot
anomalous results and calculate a

11
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:21.780
mean.

12
00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.990
You'll choose between a
bar chart and a line graph,

13
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.370
read a gradient, and estimate
the uncertainty in a set of

14
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:28.590
readings.

15
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:33.370
Your mission: decide what
to do with the odd result.
